<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq">
	<div class="container">
		<article>
				<h4>FAQs About Care Supreme-Value</h4>
						</article>
		<article>
			
									<section class="faq_acc">
<h3><span>Q.</span> Can I add my children to the Care Supreme Value health plan?</h3>

<div>Yes, you can add up to 2 children and 2 adults under the Care Supreme Value health insurance plan.</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3><span>Q.</span> Why should I opt for the Care Supreme Value health plan?</h3>

<div>Care Supreme Value is a health insurance plan that offers discrete benefits at affordable premiums. In a world where healthcare costs are skyrocketing, Care Supreme Value health insurance ensures that you do not have to break the bank or compromise on the quality of healthcare services for yourself and your family.</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3><span>Q.</span> Do I need medical check-ups to opt for Care Supreme Value health insurance?</h3>

<div>A complete health check-up may or may not be necessary to purchase a health insurance plan with Care! Although a medical checkup is not mandatory, our underwriter may request one during your policy purchase.</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3><span>Q.</span> Is a bonus offered under the Care Supreme Value health plan?</h3>

<div>Yes. Care Supreme Value offers a cumulative bonus of 50% of the sum insured, which goes up to a maximum of 100%. Additionally, you may also get up to 30% discounts on renewal premiums if you participate in our wellness programs throughout the policy year.</div>
</section>

							</div>
		</article>
	
</section>

